{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Academy: Become a Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you think you\u2019ve got what it takes?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a platformer for everyone. Academy: Become a Hero is a game of <strong>extreme precision</strong>, possibly <strong>one of the hardest on Steam</strong>. There\u2019s no room for mistakes here: every jump, every dash, and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most resilient and skillful will conquer its training circuits.<br>The rest\u2026 quit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The ultimate challenge</strong> \u2013 A platformer designed to push you to your limits. Every level is a test of patience, reflexes, and razor-sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Race against time</strong> \u2013 Beat each course before the clock hits zero. The pressure is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Elite moves</strong> \u2013 Double jump, dash, wall jump\u2026 master them <strong>and become the next Hero</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> this game <strong>is not for everyone</strong>.<br>It\u2019s a brutal training ground for those who enjoy failing over and over until they nail the perfect jump, for those who refuse to give up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Will you be one of the few to become a Hero?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411170?t=1770840451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770840451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411170/af9292771061152a0aa68b713691703ad824100a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770840451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411170/af